---
layout: base.njk
---
<div class="ph3 ph0-ns pt4 pt6-ns w-100">
    <div class="mw6-m mw7-l avenir center">
        <h1 class="f1 tc">Call for Papers</h1>
        <p class="f5 lh-copy tc">We'd love to hear from you! Submit your talk proposal below.
        After having problems with our SaaS provider for handling the talk submissions, we have
        rolled our own so we don't slow down the process.
        </p>

        <p class="f5 lh-copy tc">
        We are looking for speakers with a story to share, whether you consider yourself an expert, 
        or someone taking their first steps. We want to appeal to a broad range of experience. 
        We also want to cover real life case studies, understanding what went well and what did not. 
        We are interested in the use of tech for good. We are also keen to focus on talks that cover 
        the use of generative and agentic AI, machine learning, cloud security, sovereign cloud and 
        even containers. As a tech event in South Wales, we are always keen to here from speakers or 
        organisations that have a footprint in this area.
        </p>

        <form action="https://formspree.io/f/{{ cfp.formspreeId }}" method="POST" class="pa3 pa4-ns">
            <div class="mv3">
                <label class="db fw6 mb2 f5" for="speaker-name">Speaker Name</label>
                <input type="text" id="speaker-name" name="speaker_name" required
                    class="input-reset ba b--white pa2 w-100 f5 primaryBkg primaryColor br2">
            </div>

            <div class="mv3">
                <label class="db fw6 mb2 f5" for="email">Email</label>
                <input type="email" id="email" name="email" required
                    class="input-reset ba b--white pa2 w-100 f5 primaryBkg primaryColor br2">
            </div>

            <div class="mv3">
                <label class="db fw6 mb2 f5" for="talk-title">Talk Title</label>
                <input type="text" id="talk-title" name="talk_title" required
                    class="input-reset ba b--white pa2 w-100 f5 primaryBkg primaryColor br2">
            </div>

            <div class="mv3">
                <label class="db fw6 mb2 f5" for="abstract">Abstract</label>
                <textarea id="abstract" name="abstract" rows="6" required
                    class="input-reset ba b--white pa2 w-100 f5 primaryBkg primaryColor br2"></textarea>
            </div>

            <div class="mv3">
                <label class="db fw6 mb2 f5" for="talk-format">Talk Format</label>
                <select id="talk-format" name="talk_format" required
                    class="input-reset ba b--white pa2 w-100 f5 primaryBkg primaryColor br2">
                    <option value="">Select a format</option>
                    <option value="Main Talk (25 mins)">Main Talk (25 mins)</option>
                    <option value="Lightning Talk (10 mins)">Lightning Talk (10 mins)</option>
                </select>
            </div>

            <div class="mv3">
                <label class="db fw6 mb2 f5" for="bio">Bio</label>
                <textarea id="bio" name="bio" rows="4" required
                    class="input-reset ba b--white pa2 w-100 f5 primaryBkg primaryColor br2"></textarea>
            </div>

            <div class="mv4 tc">
                <button type="submit"
                    class="f5 fw6 ph4 pv3 input-reset ba b--transparent contrastBkg contrastColor pointer br2 grow">
                    Submit Proposal
                </button>
            </div>
        </form>
    </div>
</div>
